        "@id": "cml:DescriptionLogic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "=",
      "cml:premiseText": "digital asset means: (a) a digital representation of value or rights (including rights to property), the ownership of which is evidenced cryptographically and that is held and transferred electronically by: (i) a type of distributed ledger technology; or (ii) another distributed cryptographically verifiable data structure;"
    },
